'''Orquívoro''' ({{IPA-bl|oɾˈkiβoɾo|lang}}) is a [[W:Port|port city]] in the region of [[Piedmont]] within the [[Communities of Balisca|community]] of [[Hesperia]]. Orquívoro is considered a part of the [[Concordia|Concordia conurbation]] and lies on the northern shore of the [[Guadalquivir]], which empties into the {{W|Atlantic Ocean}}.   

